  A0 + 2 * M0 * δ₁ + 2 * σ * (2 * M0 - 1) < 2 * δ * (N - σ) →
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 < C ∧ ∀ υ P D0 Z, 1 ≤ P → 1 ≤ D0 → 2 ≤ Z → P * D0 ≤ C0 * Z ^ M0 →
